    "\n",
    "Shoes — Higher spread than tops/accessories, but not as extreme as outerwear.\n",
    "Implication: Strong candidate for segmentation (sneakers vs. heels vs. sandals).\n",
    "\n",
    "Bottoms — Moderate median, moderate spread.\n",
    "Implication: Pricing depends heavily on fabric and fit; good for size‑based inventory forecasting.\n",
    "\n",
    "Dresses — Slightly higher median than tops/bottoms, with noticeable variability.\n",
    "Implication: Occasion‑based demand makes this category sensitive to seasonality."
